1
00:00:00,337 --> 00:00:01,937
(Amy:)Being left out
is a terrible feeling.

2
00:00:01,939 --> 00:00:04,009
(Amy:)No one understands that
better than I do.

3
00:00:04,008 --> 00:00:05,808
(Sheldon:)Hey, look at that.

4
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:09,010
(Sheldon:)Even in your example,
you're all by yourself.

5
00:00:10,747 --> 00:00:12,947
(Amy:)When there was
a lice epidemic at my school,

6
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:14,750
(Amy:)everybody got it except me.

7
00:00:14,752 --> 00:00:17,752
(Amy:)I tried to fool everyone
by sprinkling sugar in my hair,

8
00:00:17,755 --> 00:00:20,855
(Amy:)but I just got attacked by bees.

9
00:00:22,259 --> 00:00:24,089
(Sheldon:)I can just picture
them all right now

10
00:00:24,095 --> 00:00:25,365
(Sheldon:)at Feynman's house,

11
00:00:25,363 --> 00:00:26,663
(Sheldon:)probably discussing Schrodinger

12
00:00:26,664 --> 00:00:28,664
(Sheldon:)and at the same time,

13
00:00:28,666 --> 00:00:30,796
(Sheldon:)not discussing Schrodinger.

14
00:00:30,801 --> 00:00:32,601
(Sheldon:)See?

15
00:00:32,603 --> 00:00:36,543
(Sheldon:)They're missing out
on hilarious jokes like that.

16
00:00:36,541 --> 00:00:38,611
(Sheldon:)And at the same time, not.

17
00:00:40,443 --> 00:00:42,513
(Sheldon:)It reminds me of when
my stupid brother and sister

18
00:00:42,513 --> 00:00:43,883
(Sheldon:)would build forts
in the living room

19
00:00:43,881 --> 00:00:45,681
(Sheldon:)and wouldn't let me in.

20
00:00:45,683 --> 00:00:48,283
(Sheldon:)I hated that so much.

21
00:00:48,286 --> 00:00:50,486
(Raj:)You know,

22
00:00:50,488 --> 00:00:51,888
(Amy:)there's nothing I can do

23
00:00:51,889 --> 00:00:53,689
(Amy:)about getting you invited
to the symposium,

24
00:00:53,691 --> 00:00:55,891
(Amy:)but if you wanted...

25
00:00:55,893 --> 00:00:58,023
(Amy:)we could build a fort.

